This offline app displays the supplied input after converting it with `ToUpperInvariant`.

## Domain rules

- The app must never use a network connection, runtime AI, or any service outside the installed contracts.
- The app must not apply explicit styling.
- The visible result is the text neuron named `answer`, which is the manifest entry.
- Opening the app is read-only and must never run domain work or change the answer.

## Initial answer

When the answer neuron is first composed, if its text is empty, set it to `Ready`. This startup composition is cheap and idempotent; if the text is not empty, leave it unchanged.

After startup composition, the answer neuron contains `Ready` when it was initially empty, and opening the app only reads that value.

## Ask

**When** the person uses the `ask` operation with supplied input.

**Then** convert the input with `ToUpperInvariant` and set the answer neuron's text to the converted value.

Afterwards, the visible text at the manifest entry is exactly the invariant-uppercase form of the supplied input, including any whitespace or punctuation.","files":{"answer.cs":"using DigitalBrain.Apps;
using DigitalBrain.Apps.Signals;
using DigitalBrain.Flutter.Text;

await using var brain = await DigitalBrainClient.ConnectAsync(args);
var app = brain.Get<IApp>(brain.Setting("App")!);
var answer = brain.Get<IText>(brain.Setting("App")! + "/answer");

var state = await answer.Read();
if (state.Version == 0)
{
    await answer.Set("Ready");
}

await foreach (var request in brain.On<AppRequested>(app, brain.Stopping))
{
    if (request.Operation == "ask")
    {
        await answer.Set(request.Input.ToUpperInvariant());
    }
}"},"settings":{},"connections":{},"version":"0.2.0","status":2,"activity":["build started","Building Uppercase Text","round 1: read_contracts","round 2: read_contracts","round 3: check_csharp","round 4: check_csharp","build finished"],"versions":[{"version":"0.1.0","savedAt":"2026-10-12T12:40:17.2466777+00:00"},{"version":"0.2.0","savedAt":"2026-10-12T12:40:34.2940965+00:00"}],"publishedVersion":null,"origin":null,"edited":true,"synapses":[]}
